    fix_text: 'Configure RHEL 9 to generate an audit event for any successful/unsuccessful use of the "delete_module" system call by adding or updating the following rules in the "/etc/audit/rules.d/audit.rules" file:\n\n-a always,exit -F arch=b32 -S delete_module -F auid>=1000 -F auid!=unset -k module_chng\n-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S delete_module -F auid>=1000 -F auid!=unset -k module_chng\n\nTo load the rules to the kernel immediately, use the following command:\n\n$ sudo augenrules --load',
